{
 "encounter_id": "00784",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi. Um, it's the anxiety. It's been bad again. I can't switch my head off at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me what happens at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get into bed and my mind races. Work, money, everything. I lie there for two hours, then wake at four, and I'm back on the treadmill."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been like this?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six weeks. Since I changed jobs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any physical symptoms with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My heart pounds, my chest feels tight, and I get sweaty hands. And I'm not eating much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any panic attacks, or thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of panic attacks, on the train. But no, no thoughts of harming myself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 50 mg once a day. I've been on it three months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it helping? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit, in the daytime. Not at night. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had depression, years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Wisdom teeth out, three years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have a drink to calm you down? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine, a couple of nights a week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 88, blood pressure 124 over 78, temperature 36.6.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Slightly fast, but normal. Any breathlessness, or chest pain that worries you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, just tightness when I'm anxious. Nothing otherwise."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. I'd say this is a flare of your anxiety, on top of a big life change, with sleep suffering."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will it go? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It usually settles with the right help. I'd like to arrange a blood test, to rule out something physical like your thyroid, and check your vitamin levels."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like you to try a sleep routine, no screens an hour before bed, a notepad by your bed to write the worries down, and keep caffeine before noon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The notepad's a good idea. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm also going to refer you for talking therapy, cognitive behavioural therapy, which is very effective."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long's the wait? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few weeks. In the meantime, there are breathing exercises on the practice website."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll look them up. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, to see how you're sleeping."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
